Squaring (i) yields  $p^2 + 2pq + q^2 = 4 - 4a + a^2$ , and substitution of (ii) into this expression gives us: $p^2 + q^2 + 2(-2a^2 + 5a - 3) = 4 - 4a + a^2$ ;

or  $4q^2 + q^2 - 4a^2 + 10a - 6 = 4 - 4a + a^2$ ;

